    "Turn on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence's on-device model reads lyrics right here, offline, and picks a passage from songs you play a lot, songs you haven't played in a while, and songs you haven't heard yet. Tap a card to play from that line.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 智能的端侧模型不联网，就在这台设备上读歌词。它会从你常听、好久没听和还没听过的歌里，各挑一段歌词放在这里，点卡片就从那句开始播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your device can run it now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台设备现在就能用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your device supports it. Turn on Apple Intelligence in Settings first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台设备支持，要先在系统设置里开启 Apple 智能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device doesn't support Apple Intelligence, so Yoin can't pick lines for you here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台设备不支持 Apple 智能，Yoin 没法在这里替你挑歌词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking…": {
